            "id": "https://rudytrnka.com/is-our-world-really-round.html",
            "url": "https://rudytrnka.com/is-our-world-really-round.html",
            "title": "Is Our World Really Round",
            "summary": "I have a sketch book from when I was in elementary school&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00912_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00912_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/20251106_023416.jpg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/20251106_023416-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00919_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00919_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00918_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00918_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00916_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00916_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00915_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00915_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00914_.png\" data-size=\"1208x904\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/58/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00914_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"575\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>I have a sketch book from when I was in elementary school and this is a drawing I did in that sketchbook that puzzles me as I wonder why I drew this. My take away is that I been thinking about the world around me my entire life, I never stopped observing and wondering about this reality we share. Of course I had to have fun with this drawing from my childhood and add a little something extra : )</p>",
