re class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/57/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01635_.png\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/57/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01635_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>Just a rough sketch studying the human form that i drew a long time ago that I knew would be fun to use with AI to make a realism photo style image.</p>",
