        {
            "id": "https://rudytrnka.com/hockey-team-collage.html",
            "url": "https://rudytrnka.com/hockey-team-collage.html",
            "title": "Hockey Team Collage",
            "summary": "This was a drawing for a friend that was a wedding present&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00907_.png\" data-size=\"1440x1016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00907_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Islander-fan-dream-lg.jpg\" data-size=\"800x567\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Islander-fan-dream-lg-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"544\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00906_.png\" data-size=\"1440x1016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00906_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00905_.png\" data-size=\"1440x1016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00905_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00902_.png\" data-size=\"1440x1016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00902_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00900_.png\" data-size=\"1440x1016\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/55/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00900_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"542\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This was a drawing for a friend that was a wedding present for an Islander Hockey fan. I used the center player as a focal to bend the reality around the scene to capture a few iconic type hockey scenes in one perspective. Because the perspectives are skewed around the center player holding the Stanley Cup it was interesting to see how AI would deal with picture.</p>",
