            "title": "Woman Resting on Chair",
            "summary": "This is a sketch that was unplanned, a surprise, and my first&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01597_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01597_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/IMG_20131211_100859.jpg\" data-size=\"1936x2592\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/IMG_20131211_100859-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01599_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01599_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01601_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01601_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01603_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01603_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01604_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01604_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01607_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01607_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01610_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01610_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01612_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01612_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01615_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01615_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01617_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01617_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01595_.png\" data-size=\"968x1296\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01595_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1028\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This is a sketch that was unplanned, a surprise, and my first time drawing somebody posing just for me. I drove some Navy buddies home a few states away and one of them knew I liked to draw and he had a surprise for me. He leads me up stairs to a apartment and tells me this girl is for you to draw, well this was a surprise, I was not expecting this and honestly one of the coolest surprises anyone has given me. She was sitting in the room just as I drew her, she did ask me what I wanted her to do and I said as you are is fine. I will admit I could have done better but I just drove for 6 hours and was a little tired but was passing up the experience. This was fun to try different AI styles converting the image to a finished art piece.</p>",
            "image": "https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/54/Qwen_Edit_2511_01601_.png",
            "author": {
                "name": "Rudy"
            },
