            "title": "Flower of Life",
            "summary": "This is my tribute to the flower of life, the geometric pattern&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01357_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01357_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/scan0025-2.jpg\" data-size=\"1653x2340\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/scan0025-2-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1087\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01356_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01356_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01354_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01354_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01353_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01353_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01352_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01352_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01351_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01351_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01350_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01350_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01349_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01349_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01345_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01345_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01343_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01343_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01340_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01340_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01339_.png\" data-size=\"992x1400\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/53/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01339_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1084\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This is my tribute to the flower of life, the geometric pattern from which all patterns can be derived. My concept was to have a flow of patterns flow around the flower center with each section merging into the next. I could play with this image for days with AI and probably will. I love using patterns and designs to create movement in an image.</p>",
