            "summary": "This odd looking creature can hear a pin drop from over 10&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01059_.png\" data-size=\"896x1264\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01059_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1083\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/scan0034.jpg\" data-size=\"1495x2117\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/scan0034-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1088\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01058_.png\" data-size=\"896x1264\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01058_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1083\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01057_.png\" data-size=\"896x1264\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/51/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_01057_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"1083\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>This odd looking creature can hear a pin drop from over 10 miles away, that is when he is not busy telling tales of adventures thru the multiverse. To start with AI for this image I wanted to see Neflah as a 3d character. I will be adding a few more images of some of Neflah's quests.</p>",
