            "title": "Too many Spicy Burritos",
            "summary": "The view from my dorm room in Manhattan, drew this when I&hellip;",
            "content_html": "<div class=\"gallery-wrapper\"><div class=\"gallery\" data-is-empty=\"false\" data-translation=\"Add images\" data-columns=\"3\">\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00892_.png\" data-size=\"1472x1104\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00892_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/20251106_103728.jpg\" data-size=\"4032x3024\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/20251106_103728-thumbnail.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n<figure class=\"gallery__item\"><a href=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00889_.png\" data-size=\"1472x1104\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://rudytrnka.com/media/posts/50/gallery/Qwen_Edit_2511_00889_-thumbnail.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"768\" height=\"576\"></a></figure>\n</div></div>\n<p>The view from my dorm room in Manhattan, drew this when I was exploring shapes and space, the negative space is just as important as the positive space. The design of the buildings around my school in Manhattan had interesting architecture, and this was more of appreciation for the simple yet elegant design. I used this sketch for further testing of using an already made layout of the general structure of the image to see how AI would add elements to the composition. The AI image was a challenge to see how it would incorporate a dual between spider an and a oversized fire breathing dog.</p>",
